{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Sunberry Care Center</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sunberry Care Center</strong> is a psychological, analog horror adventure horror game with multiple endings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon launching the application, you take on the role of a newly hired staff member at Sunberry Care Center, a facility dedicated to the treatment of a rare disease known as Sunberry Syndrome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life at Sunberry Care Center is simple. Your job is to complete routine duties involving facility management and patient care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At Sunberry Care Center, You should...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the blinds open </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the lights on </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Administer injections to patients</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><span class=\"bb_strike\">Ignore the patients if they talk to you</span></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each day, you will earn a wage based on your performance. Save diligently. By the end of the contract you should have enough to start fresh\u2014<i>far away from this wretched facility.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681700?t=1768195282","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681700?t=1768195282","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681700/263422a6fab608d238ba092d5525e123cc946c37/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768195282","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681700/263422a6fab608d238ba092d5525e123cc946c37/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768195282","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Content warnings include but are not limited to: blood, gore, abuse, body horror"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Sunberry Care Center</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sunberry Care Center</strong> is a psychological, analog horror adventure horror game with multiple endings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon launching the application, you take on the role of a newly hired staff member at Sunberry Care Center, a facility dedicated to the treatment of a rare disease known as Sunberry Syndrome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life at Sunberry Care Center is simple. Your job is to complete routine duties involving facility management and patient care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At Sunberry Care Center, You should...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the blinds open </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the lights on </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Administer injections to patients</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><span class=\"bb_strike\">Ignore the patients if they talk to you</span></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each day, you will earn a wage based on your performance. Save diligently. By the end of the contract you should have enough to start fresh\u2014<i>far away from this wretched facility.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["foolkien"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681700/14f558bb2fd2d5759a9a2ebca30288b102915366/header.jpg?t=1768195282","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3681700/881052/aba466a0de7502df17af202feb4419ce791f3b5d/1750400588/dash_av1.mpd?t=1745957778","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3681700/881052/aba466a0de7502df17af202feb4419ce791f3b5d/1750400588/dash_h264.mpd?t=1745957778","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3681700/881052/aba466a0de7502df17af202feb4419ce791f3b5d/1750400588/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1745957778","id":257132868,"name":"Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257132868/bf1ff46be2137b9137d790af37f1fe49d426c3f9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745957778"}],"name":"Sunberry Care Center","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Interl Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 620<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["foolkien"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nTemas sens\u00edveis\nDrogas